02_sinks_Load_Selections.md
03_sinks_Get_Subregions.md
# RT: first inspection, the mechanics rather than the physics
01_rt_First_Inspection.md
# Units, scaling and constants: the reference split out of First Steps
units_and_constants.md
# Pipelines: loadall, macros and bundles, run on mw_L10
pipelines.md
# Volume rendering: colour and opacity per cell, orbits and camera paths on mw_L10
17_multi_Volume_Rendering.md
# PLUTO first look: getinfo, the cell table, a projection (pluto_sedov3d)
40_pluto_First_Inspection.md
# Chombo first look: AMR levels, gravity potential (yt IsothermalSphere)
41_chombo_First_Inspection.md
# Athena++ first look: 5 AMR levels, MHD, 22M cells (yt AM06)
42_athena_First_Inspection.md
# GADGET first look: particles not a grid, families, no gethydro (yt GadgetDiskGalaxy)
44_gadget_First_Inspection.md
# AREPO first look: moving mesh, volume, deposition choice (yt ArepoBullet)
45_arepo_First_Inspection.md
# FLASH first look: PARAMESH AMR, stored temperature, mu from the file (yt GasSloshing)
